/**
 * @file
 *
 * The registry of feature names: the one list of the features this build
 * defines, features being what a ::GLECMA_FeatureSet may name that is
 * finished at TC39 and not in the pinned edition.
 *
 * Each row is `GLECMA_FEATURE(identifier, "name")`, the name being the
 * lowercase spelling a feature set carries and the test262 tag table cites.
 * Rows are appended, never renamed or removed: a host stores the names.
 *
 * The registry is empty. This library defines no feature in its first
 * release series; the first rows arrive with the work that builds a feature
 * behind the set, and until then every entry that is given a non-empty set
 * refuses it, naming the first feature, with ::GLECMA_ERR_UNSUPPORTED.
 */
